{"subject_key": "computer_organization", "subject_name": "计算机组成原理", "year": 2023, "docx_mtime": 1781623086.4865391, "questions": [{"id": "computer_organization_2023_12", "year": 2023, "number": 12, "type": "选择题", "content": "第 12 题", "image_urls": ["/static/exam_papers/11408/computer_organization/2023/img_16.jpg"], "options": {"A": "0.8 GIPS，0.4ms", "B": "0.8 GIPS，0.4μs", "C": "1.25 GIPS，0.4ms", "D": "1.25 GIPS，0.4μs"}, "answer": "C", "stem": "若机器 M 的主频为 $1.5 \\text{GHz}$，在 M 上执行程序 P 的指令条数为 $5 \\times 10^5$，P 的平均 CPI 为 1.2，则 P 在 M 上的指令执行速度和用户 CPU 时间分别为（）", "ocr_quality": "high", "need_manual_check": false}, {"id": "computer_organization_2023_13", "year": 2023, "number": 13, "type": "选择题", "content": "第 13 题", "image_urls": ["/static/exam_papers/11408/computer_organization/2023/img_17.jpg"], "options": {"A": "E002H", "B": "E001H", "C": "9FFFH", "D": "9FFE H"}, "answer": "A", "stem": "若 short 型变量 x=-8190，则 x 的机器数是（）", "ocr_quality": "high", "need_manual_check": false}, {"id": "computer_organization_2023_14", "year": 2023, "number": 14, "type": "选择题", "content": "第 14 题", "image_urls": ["/static/exam_papers/11408/computer_organization/2023/img_18.jpg"], "options": {"A": "A. -2<sup>-128</sup>", "B": "B. -1.01×2<sup>127</sup>", "C": "C. -1.01×2<sup>-126</sup>", "D": "D. 非数（NaN）"}, "answer": "A", "stem": "14. 已知 float 型变量用 IEEE 754 单精度浮点数格式表示。若 float 型变量 x 的机器数为 8020 0000H，则 x 的值是（）", "ocr_quality": "high", "need_manual_check": false}, {"id": "computer_organization_2023_15", "year": 2023, "number": 15, "type": "选择题", "content": "第 15 题", "image_urls": ["/static/exam_papers/11408/computer_organization/2023/img_19.jpg"], "options": {"A": "A.0000 0000H~0FFF FFFFH", "B": "B. 1000 0000H~2FFF FFFFH", "C": "C.3000 0000H~3FFF FFFFH", "D": "D. 4000 0000H~4FFF FFFFH"}, "answer": "C", "stem": "15. 某计算机的 CPU 有 30 根地址线，按字节编址，CPU 和主存芯片连接时，要求主存芯片占满所有的存储地址空间，并且 RAM 区和 ROM 区所分配的容量大小比为 3:1，若 RAM 在连续低地址区，ROM 在连续高地址区，则 ROM 的地址范围", "ocr_quality": "high", "need_manual_check": false}, {"id": "computer_organization_2023_16", "year": 2023, "number": 16, "type": "选择题", "content": "第 16 题", "image_urls": ["/static/exam_papers/11408/computer_organization/2023/img_20.jpg"], "options": {"A": "A.OF=0，CF=0", "B": "B.OF=0，CF=1", "C": "C.OF=1，CF=0", "D": "D.OF=1，CF=1"}, "answer": "B", "stem": "已知 x、y 为 int 类型，当 x=100、y=200 时，执行 “x 减 y” 指令得到的溢出标志 OF 和借位标志 CF 分别为 0、1，那么，当 x=10、y=-20 时，执行该指令得到的 OF 和 CF 分别为（）", "ocr_quality": "high", "need_manual_check": false}, {"id": "computer_organization_2023_17", "year": 2023, "number": 17, "type": "选择题", "content": "第 17 题", "image_urls": ["/static/exam_papers/11408/computer_organization/2023/img_21.jpg"], "options": {"A": "操作数的寻址方式", "B": "操作数的编码方式", "C": "通用寄存器的编号", "D": "通用寄存器的内容"}, "answer": "A", "stem": "某运算类指令中有一个地址码为通用寄存器编号，对应通用寄存器中存放的是操作数或操作数的地址，CPU区分两者的依据是（）", "ocr_quality": "high", "need_manual_check": false}, {"id": "computer_organization_2023_18", "year": 2023, "number": 18, "type": "选择题", "content": "第 18 题", "image_urls": ["/static/exam_papers/11408/computer_organization/2023/img_22.jpg"], "options": {"A": "算术逻辑部件(ALU)", "B": "Ⅰ、Ⅱ、Ⅳ", "C": "Ⅰ、Ⅱ、Ⅲ", "D": "Ⅲ.通用寄存器组（GPRs）"}, "answer": "B", "stem": "数据通路由组合逻辑元件（操作元件）和时序逻辑元件（状态元件）组成。下列给出的元件中，属于操作元件的是（）", "ocr_quality": "high", "need_manual_check": false}, {"id": "computer_organization_2023_19", "year": 2023, "number": 19, "type": "选择题", "content": "第 19 题", "image_urls": ["/static/exam_papers/11408/computer_organization/2023/img_23.jpg"], "options": {}, "answer": "C", "stem": "19. 在采用 “取指、译码/取数、执行、访存，写回” 5 段流水线的 RISC 处理器中，执行如下指令序列（第一列为指令序号），其中 s0、s1、s2、s3 和 t2 表示寄存器编号。", "ocr_quality": "medium", "need_manual_check": true}, {"id": "computer_organization_2023_20", "year": 2023, "number": 20, "type": "选择题", "content": "第 20 题", "image_urls": ["/static/exam_papers/11408/computer_organization/2023/img_24.jpg"], "options": {"A": "A. 8ns", "B": "B. 11ns", "C": "C. 26ns", "D": "D. 32ns"}, "answer": "D", "stem": "某存储器总线宽度为64b，总线时钟频率为1GHz，在总线上传输一个数据支或地址需要一个时钟周期，不支持突发传送方式。若通过该总线连接CPU和主存，主存每次准备一个64b数据需要6ns，主存块大小为32B，则读取一个主存块需要的时间是（）", "ocr_quality": "high", "need_manual_check": false}, {"id": "computer_organization_2023_21", "year": 2023, "number": 21, "type": "选择题", "content": "第 21 题", "image_urls": ["/static/exam_papers/11408/computer_organization/2023/img_25.jpg", "/static/exam_papers/11408/computer_organization/2023/img_26.jpg"], "options": {"A": "", "B": "", "C": "", "D": ""}, "answer": "D", "stem": "下列关于硬件和异常/中断关系的叙述中，错误的是（）", "ocr_quality": "high", "need_manual_check": false}, {"id": "computer_organization_2023_22", "year": 2023, "number": 22, "type": "选择题", "content": "第 22 题", "image_urls": ["/static/exam_papers/11408/computer_organization/2023/img_27.jpg"], "options": {"A": "查询方式下，通过 CPU 执行查询程序进行 I/O 操作", "B": "中断方式下，通过 CPU 执行中断服务程序进行 I/O 操作", "C": "DMA 方式下，通过 CPU 执行 DMA 传送程序进行 I/O 操作", "D": "对于 SSD、网络适配器等高速设备，采用 DMA 方式输入/输出"}, "answer": "C", "stem": "22.下列关于 I/O 控制方式的叙述中，错误的是（）", "ocr_quality": "high", "need_manual_check": false}, {"id": "computer_organization_2023_43", "year": 2023, "number": 43, "type": "大题", "content": "第 43 题", "image_urls": ["/static/exam_papers/11408/computer_organization/2023/img_28.jpg", "/static/exam_papers/11408/computer_organization/2023/img_29.jpg"], "options": {"A": "", "B": "", "C": "", "D": ""}, "answer": "待补充（本次上传的该年份 PDF 未检测到综合应用题参考答案）", "stem": "第 43 题", "ocr_quality": "medium", "need_manual_check": true}, {"id": "computer_organization_2023_44", "year": 2023, "number": 44, "type": "大题", "content": "第 44 题", "image_urls": ["/static/exam_papers/11408/computer_organization/2023/img_30.jpg", "/static/exam_papers/11408/computer_organization/2023/img_31.jpg"], "options": {}, "answer": "待补充（本次上传的该年份 PDF 未检测到综合应用题参考答案）", "stem": "第 44 题", "ocr_quality": "medium", "need_manual_check": true}]}